   <text type="letter">
      <body>
         <div type="writingSession">
            <pb n="1"/>
            <opener>
               Columbia University<lb/>
               in the City of <rs ref="#tillich_place_id__319" type="place">New York</rs><lb/>THE REVIEW OF RELIGION<lb/>
               <dateline>401 Low Memorial Library<lb/> <date when="1940-02-06">February 6, 1940</date></dateline>
               <salute>Dear <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1928" type="person">Professor
                  Tillich</rs>:</salute>
            </opener>
            <p>Just to remind you that your review of <rs rend="#tillich_person_id__1783"
                  type="person">Siegfried</rs>&apos;s <rs type="bibls">PROTESTANTISCHE PRINZIP IN
                  KIRCHE UND WELT</rs> is due on March first. The book was published last August,
               and we do not wish to delay any longer getting it reviewed, so we hope you can get
               the review finished without too much trouble.</p>
            <closer>
               <salute>Sincerely yours,</salute>
               <signed><rs ref="#tillich_person_id__4051" type="person"
                  ><hi rend="hand">Marguerite Block</hi>Dr. Marguerite Block</rs><lb/>Secretary</signed>
            </closer>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
